---
import learning from '../data/learning.json';
import HowItWorks from '../components/HowItWorks.astro';
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import data from '../data/content.json';
import { surahsInJuz, DEFAULT_JUZ } from '../lib/juz';
const juzOptions = Array.from({ length: 30 }, (_, i) => ({ juz: i + 1, count: surahsInJuz(i + 1).length }));
---
<Shell title="Guess the Surah">
  <section class="intro"><div class="intro-top"><span class="pill"><span class="dot"></span>114 surahs</span></div> <h1>{learning.heading}</h1> <p>A daily Quran quiz: find the surah from its clues</p><img class="motif" src="/motif.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="220" height="120" /></section>
  <script is:inline>document.body.setAttribute('data-projector','');</script>
  <noscript><div class="noscript">The guessing game needs JavaScript for scoring and clues. You can still explore the complete surah list and source references on the <a href="/sources/">sources page</a>.</div></noscript>
  <div class="workspace">
    <section class="panel" id="game-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-label="Surah guessing game">
      <div class="mode-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Game mode"><button class="mode-tab" role="tab" type="button" id="tab-daily" data-mode="daily" aria-controls="game-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Daily</button> <button class="mode-tab" role="tab" type="button" id="tab-practice" data-mode="practice" aria-controls="game-panel" aria-selected="true">Practice</button> <button class="mode-tab" role="tab" type="button" id="tab-juz" data-mode="juz" aria-controls="game-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Juz</button></div>
      <div class="mode-options"><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="arabic-first"/>Arabic first</label> <label class="check" id="streak-field" hidden><input type="checkbox" id="streak-opt"/>Keep a streak on this device</label> <span class="micro streak-line" id="streak-line" aria-live="polite"></span></div>
      <form id="setup-form" class="round-settings" aria-label="Round settings"><label class="field" id="pool-field">Collection<select id="pool"><option value="short">Short surahs · 30 ayahs or fewer</option><option value="all">All 114 surahs</option><option value="makkah">Revealed in Makkah</option><option value="madinah">Revealed in Madinah</option></select></label> <label class="field" id="juz-field" hidden>Juz<select id="juz">{juzOptions.map(o=><option value={o.juz} selected={o.juz===DEFAULT_JUZ} disabled={o.count===0}>{`Juz ${o.juz} · ${o.count===0?'no surah begins here':`${o.count} ${o.count===1?'surah':'surahs'}`}`}</option>)}</select></label> <label class="field">Length<select id="length"><option value="5">5 surahs</option><option value="10" selected>10 surahs</option><option value="20">20 surahs</option></select></label> <button class="button" type="submit">New round</button> <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="remember"/>Remember this round for up to 30 days</label></form>
      <div class="panel-head"><div><span class="label" id="round-label">Your next discovery</span><p id="round-subtitle">Take your time. Clues are here to help.</p></div> <span class="pill neutral" id="score-label">0 points</span></div>{' '}
      <div class="progress-track" role="progressbar" aria-label="Round progress" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="10" aria-valuenow="0" id="round-progress"><span id="round-bar" style="width:0%"></span></div>{' '}
      <p class="challenge-banner" id="challenge-banner" hidden>Challenge link: same clues for everyone.</p>
      <div class="panel-body" id="game-stage" aria-live="polite"><p class="muted">Preparing your clues…</p></div>
    </section>
    <aside class="sidebar sticky">
      <HowItWorks><ol><li>Read the clue ayah in Pickthall's translation.</li> <li>Reveal the Arabic, a little structure, and the meaning of the surah's name when you need them.</li> <li>Choose one of four surahs. Earlier answers earn more points.</li></ol><p><strong>Daily</strong> is one surah a day, cycling through all 114. The number (#N) changes at your local midnight, so two people in different time zones can be on different numbers. Finish it and a reload shows your result. <strong>Practice</strong> is always available and never affects Daily. <strong>Juz</strong> draws rounds from the surahs whose first ayah falls in the juz you choose (Juz 30 to start); Juz 2 and 5 have no surah beginning in them. Juz boundaries come from Quran MCP metadata.</p><p>The Arabic-first option shows the Arabic ayah as the first clue. The last clue is the usual English meaning of the surah's name, from the Quran.com API (v4, chapters endpoint); for names such as Ya Sin it is the name itself.</p><p>An informal challenge, with identical clues for anyone using the link. Points reflect how early you answer; they are not a memorization score.</p><p><strong>Stored on this device only</strong>, under the prefix <code>guess-the-surah:</code>, for up to 30 days since the last write: <code>daily</code> (today's number and your result), <code>streakOn</code> and <code>streak</code> (only if you tick "Keep a streak"), <code>found</code> (the surahs you have found, for the 114 collection), <code>arabicFirst</code>, and <code>round</code> and <code>remember</code> (only if you tick remember). Nothing is sent to a server. If storage is blocked, the game still works but keeps no streak or saved result.</p></HowItWorks>
    </aside>
  </div>
  <details class="top-gap panel panel-body collection" open><summary>114 collection <span class="pill neutral" id="collection-count">0 of 114 found</span></summary> <p class="micro">Surahs you have named correctly on this device. Daily, Practice and Juz all count.</p> <ol class="collection-grid" id="collection-grid">{data.chapters.map(s=><><li data-n={s.number}><span class="n">{s.number}</span>{" "}<span class="sr-only state"> not found yet</span></li>{" "}</>)}</ol></details>
  <details class="top-gap panel panel-body"><summary>Surah list (shows answers)</summary><div class="surah-directory">{data.chapters.map(s=><><a href={`https://quran.com/${s.number}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="surah-number">{s.number}</span> <span>{s.name_simple} <small>{s.verses_count} ayahs</small></span> <span lang="ar" dir="rtl">{s.name_arabic}</span></a>{' '}</>)}</div></details>
</Shell>
<script>import '../lib/game';</script>
<style>
  summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600}.surah-directory{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;margin-top:22px}.surah-directory a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--ink)}.surah-directory small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.66rem;margin-top:3px}.surah-directory [lang=ar]{margin-left:auto;font-family:Amiri,serif;font-size:1.05rem}.surah-number{color:var(--muted);font-size:.68rem;min-width:20px}@media(max-width:860px){.surah-directory{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:580px){.surah-directory{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.intro{position:relative}.intro .motif{position:absolute;right:0;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);color:var(--accent);opacity:.55;pointer-events:none}@media(max-width:580px){.intro .motif{display:none}}.round-settings{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr auto;gap:10px 12px;align-items:end;padding:14px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.round-settings .field{margin:0;font-size:.72rem}.round-settings .check{grid-column:1/-1;margin:0}.round-settings .button{min-height:45px}.challenge-banner{margin:0;padding:10px 22px;font-size:.8rem;background:var(--tint);color:var(--accent-ink)}@media(max-width:580px){.round-settings{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;padding:12px 16px}.round-settings .button{grid-column:1/-1}}
</style>
